{
  "bookId": "hero-213015",
  "id": "bond-28558",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28558001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "今日罗威有事外出，如有照顾不周的地方，还望海涵。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不用这么正经，只是顺路过来看看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "既然如此……请您靠过来一些。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "请再向前靠近一些。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "伊迪丝轻轻地踮起脚，伸出双手，整理了一下你的领口。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "怎么了，为什么露出这样的表情？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28558009",
              "text": "感觉有点难为情。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28558009",
              "text": "感觉有点不自然。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28558008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "失礼了，只是觉得凌乱的领口有损您的形象。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这不太像是你的做法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "倘若珠玉蒙尘，我也会忍不住亲手擦拭。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "在管家不在的当下，由我来做也是最有效率的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好像被夸了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "想好要商讨些什么了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28558015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊迪丝",
          "text": "今天的日程安排还算宽松，我们可以慢慢聊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
